sequenceDiagram
 participant p0 as Student
 participant p1 as Instructor
 participant p2 as API / rules
 participant p3 as SQLite
 p0->>p1: Show signed QR (120s; refresh every 30s)
 p1->>p2: POST /class-qr-check-ins {classId, token}
 p2->>p2: Verify assigned instructor, time and signature
 p2->>p3: BEGIN IMMEDIATE; read subscription + booking
 p3-->>p2: Require active suitable plan AND confirmed booking
 p2->>p3: Set checked_in; notify and audit; COMMIT
 p2-->>p1: Success, or already checked in on repeat
